 * Parses the input text into a task map (name -> cost) and an adjacency map
 * (name -> Set of dependency names). Throws a `CliError` for any malformed
 * directive, an invalid name or cost, a task declared twice, or a `dep` line
 * that names a task no `task` line declares.
